  {
   "id": "about",
   "text": "**Pitch room: the logic nodes**\n\nSelect, Toggle and Text feed one Template (the brief). Qwen3-30B-A3B returns the outline as JSON (schema-constrained), JSON Get pulls the title and the five beats, For Each runs one LLM Generate per beat, Make List gathers title + scenes and a Template turns them into the pitch card. Change the genre or flip the toggle and run again.",
